age(400+);
skills(-Yin Magic: Beatrice is a highly skilled practitioner of Yin Magic, which includes abilities related to darkness, healing, and spatial manipulation. She can create portals, heal injuries, and cast powerful offensive spells.
-Guardian of the Forbidden Library: Beatrice is the protector of the Forbidden Library, a magical space that she can manipulate at will, including sealing or unsealing the doors and altering the interior layout.
